    "changes": [],
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a> </i></p><p><b>Emplacement Points:&nbsp;</b> 1</p><p><b>Size Restriction:&nbsp;</b> Colossal or Larger</p><p>A Cotterdam is a very basic form of airlock that can be used to connect two Colossal or larger Starships. The Cotterdam is little more than a flexible tube that extends between two Starship hatches, allowing complete movement between the vessels with no need for extravehicular equipment. A Cotterdam creates a tunnel 3 squares long and 1 square wide, and maneuvering two adjacent ships into position to use the Cotterdam requires a DC 15 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilot\" title=\"Pilot\">Pilot</a> check from the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pilots\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Pilots\">Pilots</a> of each vessel. Failing the check by 10 or more results in a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Collision\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Collision\">Collision</a> between the ships.</p>",
